!SUPPLEMENT DATA FOR 
!"A KINETIC MODELING STUDY ON THE OXIDATION OF PRIMARY REFERENCE FUEL-TOLUENE MIXTURES INCLUDING CROSS REACTIONS BETWEEN AROMATICS AND ALIPHATICS"
!YASUYUKI SAKAI, AKIRA MIYOSHI, MITSUO KOSHI AND WILLIAM J. PITZ
!-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!GASOLINE SURROGATE FUEL OXIDATION MECHANISM
!THIS MECHANISM CONTAINS THE OXIDATION OF N-HEPTANE, ISO-OCTANE, ETHANOL,
!ETHYL TERT-BUTYL ETHER AND TOLUENE.
!
!THIS KINETIC MODEL HAS BEEN CONSTRUCTED BASED ON PRF/ETBE/ETHANOL MODEL BY T.OGURA, TOLUENE MODEL BY W.J. PITZ.!
!
!REFERENCE
!OGURA, T., SAKAI, Y., MIYOSHI, A., KOSHI, M., DAGAUT, P., MODELING OF THE OXIDATION OF PRIMARY REFERENCE FUEL IN THE PRESENCE OF OXYGENATED IMPROVERS: ETHYL TERT-BUTYL ETHER AND ETHANOL, ENERGY & FUELS 21 (2007) 3233-3239.
!SAKAI, Y., INAMURA, T., OGURA, T., KOSHI, M, PITZ, W.J., DETAILED KINETIC MODELING OF TOLUENE COMBUSTION OVER A WIDE RANGE OF TEMPERATURE AND PRESSURE, SAE PAPER, JSAE 20077139/SAE 2007-01-1885 (2007).
!SAKAI, Y., OZAWA, H., OGURA, T., MIYOSHI, A., KOSHI, M., PITZ, W.J., EFFECTS OF TOLUENE ADDITION TO PRIMARY REFERENCE FUEL AT HIGH TEMPERATURE, SAE PAPER, SAE2007-01-4104 (2007).
!PITZ, W.J., SEISER, R., BOZZELLI, J.W., DA COSTA, I., FOURNET, R., BILLAUD, F., BATTIN-LECLERC, F., SESHADRI, K., WESTBROOK, C.K., CHEMICAL KINETIC CHARACTERIZATION OF THE COMBUSTION OF TOLUENE, PROC. OF THE 2ND JOINT MEETING OF THE U.S. SECTIONS OF THE COMBUSTION INSTITUTE (2001).
!-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
